; todo-v02-open.sabra — the v0.2 filter query: prelude accessors only.
;
; The 12.5 query reached for first/second/rec-val on numeric keys;
; v0.2 names the fields (todo-entry todo-state todo-title todo-open).
; Same reach, no calculus: filter the entry list by state, collect the
; titles in board order.
;
; SHAPE NOTE (probe-found, 2026-10-02): the composition must keep its
; lambdas INLINE and its def applications DIRECT.  list-map applied to
; a def-spliced lambda argument misapplies (machine AND CL reference
; agree on the wrong answer - FINDINGS non-F note), and list-append is
; a broken v1 def (append xs ys = reverse(xs) ++ ys; append 0 x = x -
; FINDINGS non-F note).  The collection therefore rides an inline
; pair-prepend list-fold: list-fold traverses right-to-left, so the
; prepend preserves board order.

(lambda (prefix)
  (let ((open-items
          (list-filter
            (lambda (entry)
              (tree-eq (todo-state (todo-entry entry)) todo-open))
            (prim "tree/list" prefix))))
    (list-fold
      (lambda (entry) (lambda (acc) (pair (todo-title (todo-entry entry)) acc)))
      0
      open-items)))
